Just a minor point - even if you are wearing boots, you will still
take a point or two of damage from xans. But, you won't get wounded
legs, so it's not too bad...

On another note - I just started playing Nethack this week. I spent
ages messing with Hack 1.02 and 1.03, but things seem to have changed
a fair bit. My question - in old hack, you got down to the maze levels,
found a wand of wishing under a rock, and then teleported down to level
40 or so to kill the wizard of yendor and get the amulet. That doesn't
seem to be the case now, I've gone thru a few mazes and not found the
wand of wishing... What's the scoop? There's absolutely no mention of
what to do with mazes in the spoiler file...
